args.Content:
The file server interface has been refactored so that it is loaded and streamed directly from [`Project.MM/LocalConfig/data/www/fileserver.html`](https://github.com/b1tranger/Microprocessor_Assembly_Lab/blob/main/Project.MM/LocalConfig/data/www/fileserver.html) (via `/www/fileserver.html` on the MicroSD card) instead of being built from hardcoded C++ HTML strings in `src/main.cpp`.

---

### Architectural Refactoring Details

1. **Direct SD Streaming via `server.streamFile()`**:
   - In [`src/main.cpp`](https://github.com/b1tranger/Microprocessor_Assembly_Lab/blob/main/Project.MM/LocalConfig/src/main.cpp), `handleRoot()` now opens and streams `/www/fileserver.html` directly from the MicroSD card:
     ```cpp
     void handleRoot() {
       if (SD.exists("/www/fileserver.html")) {
         File htmlFile = SD.open("/www/fileserver.html", FILE_READ);
         server.streamFile(htmlFile, "text/html");
         htmlFile.close();
         return;
       }
       server.send(404, "text/plain", "File Server Interface Not Found on MicroSD (/www/fileserver.html)");
     }
     ```
   - The former C++ HTML assembly routines (`meter`, `uploadBox`, `tableStart`, and procedural row generation) in `src/main.cpp` have been eliminated from the primary route.

2. **Dedicated JSON REST API (`/api/files`)**:
   - Added `handleApiFiles()` at `/api/files` in `src/main.cpp`.
   - Returns live JSON metadata containing formatted storage statistics (`total`, `used`, `usedFormatted`, `totalFormatted`, `usedPercent`) and an array of files (`path`, `name`, `dir`, `size`, `sizeFormatted`, `isProtected`).

3. **Client-Side Dynamic Hydration in `fileserver.html`**:
   - In [`data/www/fileserver.html`](https://github.com/b1tranger/Microprocessor_Assembly_Lab/blob/main/Project.MM/LocalConfig/data/www/fileserver.html), added `loadFiles()`:
     - On page load (`DOMContentLoaded`), it queries `/api/files` and dynamically populates the storage utilization meter and file directory table.
     - When uploads complete, it calls `loadFiles()` to refresh the file table without requiring a full page reload.
     - In offline / local file mode (`file:///`), network errors are gracefully caught so the static preview rows remain visible.

4. **Asset Synchronization**:
   - Re-generated [`include/default_assets.h`](https://github.com/b1tranger/Microprocessor_Assembly_Lab/blob/main/Project.MM/LocalConfig/include/default_assets.h) via `generate_assets.ps1` to ensure `/www/fileserver.html` is embedded in Flash ROM and auto-seeded to `/www/` upon storage initialization.

